        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "As the success of our business is fundamentally connected to the well-being of our people, we offer benefits that support their physical, financial and emotional well-being.",
        "start_character": 39340,
        "end_character": 39513
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000832428-26-000010",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000832428-26-000010-b297ece9eca47892",
        "accession_number": "0000832428-26-000010",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-27",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "To support their growth and align with the evolving needs of our business, we have prioritized offering flexible, impactful learning and development opportunities.",
        "start_character": 40809,
        "end_character": 40972
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000832428-26-000010",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000832428-26-000010-b297ece9eca47892",
        "accession_number": "0000832428-26-000010",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-27",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "In February 2026, we announced an enterprise-wide transformation plan that is designed to improve operating performance and unlock new value and targets annualized enterprise EBITDA growth of $125 million to $150 million by 2028.",
        "start_character": 7452,
        "end_character": 7681
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000832428-26-000010",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000832428-26-000010-b297ece9eca47892",
        "accession_number": "0000832428-26-000010",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-27",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "In October 2025, we reached agreement to sell WRTV, our local ABC- affiliated station in Indianapolis, Indiana, for $83.0 million.",
        "start_character": 5692,
        "end_character": 5822
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000832428-26-000010",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000832428-26-000010-b297ece9eca47892",
        "accession_number": "0000832428-26-000010",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-27",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "In exchange, we pay affiliation fees to the network, and the network sells a substantial majority of the advertising time during these broadcasts.",
        "start_character": 15149,
        "end_character": 15295
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000832428-26-000010",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000832428-26-000010-b297ece9eca47892",
        "accession_number": "0000832428-26-000010",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-27",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "On September 3, 2025, we reached an agreement to sell WFTX, our local Fox-affiliated station in Fort Myers, Florida, for $40.0 million.",
        "start_character": 5454,
        "end_character": 5589
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000832428-26-000010",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000832428-26-000010-b297ece9eca47892",
        "accession_number": "0000832428-26-000010",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-27",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "This is why we offer a comprehensive benefits package known as the Scripps Choice Plan, which is designed to meet the needs of our workforce.",
        "start_character": 40550,
        "end_character": 40691
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000832428-26-000010",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000832428-26-000010-b297ece9eca47892",
        "accession_number": "0000832428-26-000010",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-27",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We focus on building a high-performing organization by attracting, developing and retaining future-ready talent with the skills, leadership and adaptability required.",
        "start_character": 37097,
        "end_character": 37263
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000832428-26-000010",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000832428-26-000010-b297ece9eca47892",
        "accession_number": "0000832428-26-000010",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-27",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.86,
        "statement": "On May 14, 2025, we announced a multi-year media rights agreement which allows us to produce and distribute all preseason, regular season and first-round playoff Tampa Bay Lightning games that are not allocated exclusively to national broadcasts.",
        "start_character": 3376,
        "end_character": 3622
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000832428-26-000010",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000832428-26-000010-b297ece9eca47892",
        "accession_number": "0000832428-26-000010",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-27",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.86,
        "statement": "These arrangements are generally governed by multi-year contracts and the fees we receive are typically based on the number of subscribers the respective distributor has in our markets and the contracted rate per subscriber.",
        "start_character": 13800,
        "end_character": 14024
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000832428-26-000010",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000832428-26-000010-b297ece9eca47892",
        "accession_number": "0000832428-26-000010",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-27",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.86,
        "statement": "We are committed to fostering a culture of continuous learning.",
        "start_character": 41165,
        "end_character": 41228
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000832428-26-000010",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000832428-26-000010-b297ece9eca47892",
        "accession_number": "0000832428-26-000010",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-27",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.86,
        "statement": "We expect to continue to look for opportunities to centralize functions that do not require a local market presence.",
